              "expect": "refused",
              "why": "Apple's Containerization can't protect your network: its guests sit on Apple's vmnet network, which only pf can filter (pf needs root), and a firewall inside the guest would not hold against the Space's own root. Use the Cua microVM monitor (`--runtime vz`: cua-vz and cua-microvm-init, which the Cua Spaces app ships next to `cua`) or choose No protection."
